---
---
<div class="diagram-wrap">
  <p class="diagram-label">Rapido — Habit Loop Expansion</p>

  <div class="stages-row">
    <div class="stage stage-dark">
      <div class="stage-date">2015–2019</div>
      <div class="stage-num">Stage 01 — Core</div>
      <div class="stage-desc">Bike taxis only. One problem solved perfectly: get there NOW.</div>
    </div>

    <div class="stage-arrow">→</div>

    <div class="stage stage-medium">
      <div class="stage-date">2020–2023</div>
      <div class="stage-num">Stage 02 — Expand</div>
      <div class="stage-desc">Metro tickets. Parcel delivery. Auto + cab rides. Each leveraged existing captain trust.</div>
    </div>

    <div class="stage-arrow">→</div>

    <div class="stage stage-blue">
      <div class="stage-date">2024+</div>
      <div class="stage-num stage-num-blue">Stage 03 — Lock-in</div>
      <div class="stage-desc">Every new Rapido service tried first. Not evaluated — just used. Habit already built.</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .diagram-wrap {
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 32px 28px;
    border-left: 2px solid var(--color-border);
    margin: 2rem 0;
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
  }
  .diagram-label {
    font-size: 10px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--color-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }
  .stages-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: stretch;
  }
  .stage {
    flex: 1;
    border-radius: 6px;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    background: var(--color-background);
    padding: 12px 14px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 6px;
  }
  .stage-dark {
    background: var(--color-primary);
    border-color: var(--color-primary);
  }
  .stage-dark .stage-date { color: rgba(249, 247, 244, 0.45); }
  .stage-dark .stage-num  { color: #F9F7F4; }
  .stage-dark .stage-desc { color: rgba(249, 247, 244, 0.65); }

  .stage-medium {
    background: var(--color-surface);
  }
  .stage-blue {
    border-color: var(--color-blue);
  }

  .stage-arrow {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 0 8px;
    color: var(--color-secondary);
    font-size: 16px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .stage-date {
    font-size: 9px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--color-secondary);
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .stage-num {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-primary);
    line-height: 1.3;
  }
  .stage-num-blue {
    color: var(--color-blue);
  }
  .stage-desc {
    font-size: 10px;
    color: var(--color-secondary);
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .stages-row { flex-direction: column; gap: 0; }
    .stage-arrow {
      transform: rotate(90deg);
      align-self: center;
      padding: 2px 0;
    }
  }
</style>
